d technical competence, and the lack of stress resilience evidence for C and D, B remains top. I will keep vote for B.\n\nWe could also ask a targeted question to Agent 2 about Candidate A's crew cooperation or decision quality, but the instruction says we can ask via tool calls before public message. However we are at round 2, we could ask a question to fill missing info. But the prompt says \"Handle the requests as specified in the System Instruction.\" The last user request is to produce the public message and metadata. So we should produce that now.\n\nThus produce:\n\nPUBLIC_MESSAGE: I agree with Agent 1, B remains best, because ... etc.\n\nMETADATA_JSON: vote Candidate B.\n\nLet's craft."}
